      <name>PH.3.5.4#08</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to manage PHR Account Holder notifications and/or reminders based on configuration options (e.g., repetitions or timing of the activity).</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
