      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHOULD" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="PH.3.5.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="13" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>9f587e05-3e74-48ee-8829-b81ea425b471</id>
      <name>PH.3.5.4#14</name>
      <notes>IF indications for specific preventive services and accompanying reminders were previously captured, THEN the system SHALL present reminders to the PHR Account Holder of all specific preventive services (e.g., a follow up examination that is scheduled in the coming week).</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>8b20407d-3890-46ad-9423-70728bd11805</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="342" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="Y" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="PH.3.5.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="14" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>fae5d6ba-c01a-4ff4-8d38-411915d37229</id>
      <name>PH.3.5.4#15</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to receive secure messages of reminders or notifications from the PHR Account Holder's provider(s) to remind the PHR Account Holder of tests or actions that are due or overdue.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>8b20407d-3890-46ad-9423-70728bd11805</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="343" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHOULD" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="PH.3.5.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="15" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>43c374d5-8ef3-4445-bd98-c1b66ccb836d</id>
      <name>PH.3.5.4#16</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to update a repetitive reminder by dismissing the reminder.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>8b20407d-3890-46ad-9423-70728bd11805</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="344" />
