      <id>8b7753bf-5fb4-4884-9a95-0ca8aa9b5069</id>
      <name>PH.6.3#02</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to manage scanned documents based on the document type (e.g., based on the quality, format, origin, completion status, or intended diagnostic use (e.g., a screening versus a diagnostic breast examination)).</notes>
