    <object>
      <id>d665770a-fc33-453f-8502-c45572e48dd5</id>
      <name>PH.6.3#03</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to capture and maintain communications (e.g., date, entity, or details of communication) that were originated by the PHR Account Holder or Authorized PHR User.</notes>
