      <id>57facc65-7dee-4162-b787-207171ac49a8</id>
      <name>PH.6.3#04</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL provide the ability to capture, maintain and render PHR authorization information (e.g., to support a designee's claim that the designee is authorized to receive PHR Account Holder-related health information).</notes>
