      <name>PH.6.3#10</name>
      <notes>IF the PHR Account Holder is creating a self-generated care plan, THEN the system SHOULD provide the ability for the PHR Account Holder to tag a set of selected care team members (to whom the PHR Account Holder intends to send certain information).</notes>
