      <id>e2d03659-1f01-4d2c-9141-3f4d41a587d7</id>
      <name>PH.6.3#11</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to transmit a tagged set of elements within the PHR Account Holder's self-generated care plan to a tagged set of selected care team members.</notes>
