      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="11" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4</name>
      <alias>RI.1.1.4</alias>
      <notes>$ST$Attest Record Entries (1 or more instances)$DE$Occurs when an agent causes the system to capture the agent's digital signature (or equivalent indication) during formal validation of record entry content. 

Reference: ISO 21089-2018, Section 15.4.$EX$</notes>
      <stereotype>Function</stereotype>
      <type>Feature</type>
      <parentId>329261ec-e26e-4601-9551-951f72952d69</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="846" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="C" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>b3706371-62ca-4d4b-98e9-07e9cd3c7cc7</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#01</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL conform to function [[TI.1.1]] (Entity Authentication).</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="847" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="1" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>520be54c-eeb5-4e68-9a3c-7b9a229813ec</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#02</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL conform to function [[TI.1.2]] (Entity Authorization).</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="848" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="2" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>ae56f8ad-26c5-4605-b5be-f274dcda541a</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#03</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL provide the ability to attest (approve and apply signature to) Record Entry content by the author.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="849" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="3" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>c2e5eef3-de83-4613-86df-56c4b053ef8d</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#04</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL capture the signature event (e.g., digital signature) of the Attesting Author, binding signature to Record Entry content.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="850" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="4" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>3540959c-f86b-4f9c-a2c3-96e0aaebe7a3</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#05</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL provide the ability to maintain any attestable Record Entry content added or changed with the content's author</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="851" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="5" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>990e264b-e0a4-43d6-8ede-dec765edcc74</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#06</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL present the status of attestable Record Entry content which has not been attested, conforming to function [[RI.1.3.1]] (Record Pending State).</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="852" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="6" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>8765c794-92bf-4707-a735-b726b3f09add</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#07</name>
      <notes>IF the attester is different than the author(s), THEN the system SHALL provide the ability to maintain Record Entry content by properly authenticated and authorized users different from the author (e.g., counter-signature) according to scope of practice, organizational policy, and/or jurisdictional law.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="853" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="Y" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="Y" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="7" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>504157e5-5f71-4dd1-a2d1-18bc96e39fab</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#08</name>
      <notes>The system SHOULD provide the ability to manage digital signatures as the means for attestation.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="854" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHOULD" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="8" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>26baa6ef-eb07-4504-a8de-4ee54dd05a7c</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#09</name>
      <notes>IF more than one author contributed to the Record Entry content, THEN the system SHALL provide the ability to maintain all authors/contributors associated with their content.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="855" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="Y" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="9" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>08a220d8-79c1-4b5f-a6ff-56cd285587a5</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#10</name>
      <notes>IF Record Entry content is attested by someone other than the author, THEN the system SHALL maintain and display the author(s) and attester.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="856" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="Y" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="N" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="10" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>8c83d895-eb84-48e9-b77b-f35415f93c69</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#11</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL provide the ability to present a minimum set of information that identifies the author of Record Entry content according to scope of practice, organizational policy, and/or jurisdictional law (e.g., name, credential, and/or role (such as Karen Smith, RN)).</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="857" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
      <tag name="Conditional" value="N" />
      <tag name="Dependent" value="Y" />
      <tag name="Reference.Alias" value="PHR_R2" />
      <tag name="Reference.FunctionID" value="RI.1.1.4" />
      <tag name="Reference.CriterionID" value="11" />
      <tag name="Reference.ChangeIndicator" value="NC" />
      <tag name="Priority" value="EN" />
    </object>
    <object>
      <id>d2b8b2a4-a1fe-49c2-a7dc-cb4f88f8597e</id>
      <name>RI.1.1.4#12</name>
      <notes>The system SHALL capture the signature type of the entity (individual, PHR or other system, or organization) sending Record Entry content.</notes>
      <stereotype>Criteria</stereotype>
      <type>Requirement</type>
      <parentId>b2aecc7d-042f-4dff-9f7e-9d3be485d6c1</parentId>
      <tag name="Row" value="858" />
      <tag name="Optionality" value="SHALL" />
